#   editprofile     - Edit this file
#   path_show       - Display PATH in readable format
#   path_doctor     - Check PATH health and Homebrew priority
#   versions        - Show installed tool versions
#   sysinfo         - Display system information
#   histclean       - Deduplicate history
#   histstats       - Show history statistics
#   histnuke        - Clear all history
